      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: af73619e05e6a42daae843f3eed561c8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: characterName
      value: Potsmaster
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: af73619e05e6a42daae843f3eed561c8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: journalInformation
      value: The potsmaster said I should ask about the wax seal at the bookstore
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: af73619e05e6a42daae843f3eed561c8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[0]'
      value: This was left under the post office door. No stamp, no address, no indication
        that it was ever meant to enter the system.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: af73619e05e6a42daae843f3eed561c8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: "The seal is familiar, though I can\u2019t place it. I saw a picture
        of it once, in a book."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: af73619e05e6a42daae843f3eed561c8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[2]'
      value: "You might ask the bookseller. If the picture still exists, they\u2019ll
        know where to find it."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: af73619e05e6a42daae843f3eed561c8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[3]'
      value: Just try to deliver it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
